#: ../../source/glossary.rst:2
msgid "Glossary"
msgstr "术语表"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:5
msgid "QM/MM"
msgstr "QM/MM"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:7
msgid ""
"Quantum mechanics/molecular mechanics. q2m3 treats a small QM region with PySCF and PennyLane. It"
" represents the solvent environment with classical point charges and MM force-field terms."
msgstr "量子力学 / 分子力学。q2m3 使用 PySCF 和 PennyLane 处理小型 QM 区域，使用经典点电荷和 MM 力场项表示溶剂环境。"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:10
msgid "QPE"
msgstr "QPE"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:12
msgid ""
"Quantum phase estimation. q2m3 uses QPE circuits to estimate molecular energies from a time-"
"evolution phase."
msgstr "量子相位估计。q2m3 使用 QPE 电路，从时间演化相位估计分子能量。"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:14
msgid "SQD"
msgstr "SQD"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:16
msgid ""
"Sample-based quantum diagonalization. q2m3 prepares a CCSD-seeded LUCJ state in ffsim, samples "
"fixed-particle-number determinants, and solves the Hamiltonian in the recovered subspace with "
"qiskit-addon-sqd."
msgstr "基于采样的量子对角化。q2m3 在 ffsim 中制备以 CCSD 为种子的 LUCJ 态，采样固定粒子数行列式，并使用 qiskit-addon-sqd 在恢复的子空间中求解哈密顿量。"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:19
msgid "LUCJ"
msgstr "LUCJ"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:21
msgid ""
"Local unitary cluster Jastrow ansatz used by the SQD workflow. Its repetition count and optional "
"spin-channel connectivity are explicit run inputs."
msgstr "SQD 工作流使用的局域幺正簇 Jastrow 拟设。重复次数和可选的自旋通道连通性均为显式运行输入。"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:24
msgid "reference tier"
msgstr "参考层级"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:26
msgid ""
"The SQD baseline policy: T0 exact active-space CASCI, T1 selected CI, explicitly registered T1+ "
"plugins, or diagnostic T2 CCSD(T). A tier records method and uncertainty semantics. It is not an "
"accuracy label by itself."
msgstr "SQD 基准策略：T0 为活性空间内精确 CASCI，T1 为选择 CI，T1+ 为显式注册的插件，T2 为诊断性 CCSD(T)。层级记录方法和不确定性的含义，本身不是精度标签。"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:30
msgid "EFTQC"
msgstr "EFTQC"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:32
msgid ""
"Early fault-tolerant quantum computer. q2m3 uses this term for resource-estimation studies such "
"as logical qubit and Toffoli counts."
msgstr "早期容错量子计算机。q2m3 在逻辑量子比特数和 Toffoli 门数等资源估计研究中使用此术语。"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:34
msgid "RDM"
msgstr "RDM"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:36
msgid ""
"Reduced density matrix. q2m3 uses the 1-RDM for Mulliken population analysis and quantum-to-"
"classical observable transfer."
msgstr "约化密度矩阵。q2m3 使用 1-RDM 进行 Mulliken 布居分析，并将量子可观测量传递到经典计算。"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:38
msgid "active space"
msgstr "活性空间"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:40
msgid ""
"The selected electrons and orbitals included in a quantum calculation. q2m3 documents active "
"spaces as electrons/orbitals and the resulting system qubit count."
msgstr "量子计算中选定的电子和轨道。q2m3 以电子数 / 轨道数及对应系统量子比特数记录活性空间。"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:43
msgid "Trotterization"
msgstr "Trotter 分解"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:45
msgid ""
"Approximation of Hamiltonian time evolution by decomposing it into products of simpler "
"exponentials. Trotter depth affects QPE accuracy and Catalyst compile size."
msgstr "将哈密顿量的时间演化分解为较简单指数算符的乘积，以得到近似。Trotter 深度影响 QPE 精度和 Catalyst 编译规模。"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:48
msgid "delta_corr-pol"
msgstr "delta_corr-pol"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:50
msgid ""
"Correlation-polarization coupling: the change in electronic correlation energy caused by the MM "
"environment."
msgstr "电子相关与极化的耦合：MM 环境引起的电子相关能变化。"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:52
msgid "Catalyst"
msgstr "Catalyst"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:54
msgid ""
"The PennyLane compilation stack used for ``@qjit`` workflows. q2m3 uses it where compile-once"
"/reuse-many execution is intended."
msgstr "用于 ``@qjit`` 工作流的 PennyLane 编译栈。q2m3 在预期编译一次、多次复用的场景中使用它。"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:56
msgid "IR cache"
msgstr "IR 缓存"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:58
msgid ""
"A cache of Catalyst intermediate representation artifacts used to avoid repeating expensive "
"compilation stages for unchanged circuit structure."
msgstr "Catalyst 中间表示产物的缓存。当电路结构不变时，可避免重复执行成本较高的编译阶段。"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:60
msgid "Hartree"
msgstr "Hartree"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:62
msgid "Internal energy unit used by q2m3."
msgstr "q2m3 使用的内部能量单位。"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:63
msgid "kcal/mol"
msgstr "kcal/mol"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:65
msgid "Reporting unit used only after explicit conversion from Hartree."
msgstr "仅在从 Hartree 显式转换后使用的报告单位。"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:66
msgid "Hamiltonian 1-norm"
msgstr "哈密顿量 1-范数"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:68
msgid "Sum-of-coefficients measure used by the EFTQC resource-estimation path."
msgstr "EFTQC 资源估计路径使用的系数求和度量。"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:69
msgid "MM embedding"
msgstr "MM 嵌入"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:71
msgid "Electrostatic coupling of classical point charges into the QM Hamiltonian."
msgstr "将经典点电荷以静电耦合形式引入 QM 哈密顿量。"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:73
msgid "phase wrapping"
msgstr "相位回绕"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:75
msgid "Ambiguity caused when the energy phase exceeds the finite QPE register range and wraps modulo one."
msgstr "能量相位超出有限 QPE 寄存器范围并按模一回绕时产生的歧义。"
